.TH MRS_TOOLS-INFO "1" "July 2024" "" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
.B mrs_tools\ info
\(en Information about the NIfTI-MRS file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mrs_tools\ info
.RB [ \-h ]
.I FILE\fR\ or\ list\ of\ \fIFILE\fRs
.RI [ FILE\fR\ or\ list\ of\ \fIFILE\fRs ...]
.SH OPTIONS
.SS "POSITIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.I FILE\fR\ or\ list\ of\ \fIFILE\fRs
NIfTI MRS file(s)
Information about the NIfTI-MRS file.
.SS "OPTIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.B \-h\fR,\ \fB\-\-help
Show a help message and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-full\-hdr
Display the full header extension.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR mrs_tools (1)
.P
.\" .BR mrs_tools\-info (1),
.BR mrs_tools\-vis (1),
.BR mrs_tools\-merge (1),
.BR mrs_tools\-split (1),
.BR mrs_tools\-reorder (1),
.BR mrs_tools\-reshape (1),
.BR mrs_tools\-conjugate (1)
